        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"godzilla999666\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/ccd318/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> godzilla999666:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How many cards does one of the inserts hold?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Based on a converstaion I ahd with a Go7 representative he said</p>\n<p>\"  I currently have the enhanced base and the two big box expansions (Wrath is on the way) plus the all of the mini expansions unsleeved and I have one entirely empty box and one (of five) card sections empty in one box.&nbsp; If you sleeve, you will need one expansion per big box (sleeve thickness varies, but you should be fine.) &nbsp;I place the big villain cards on top of the inserts in a box and the rules on top in another box. &nbsp;\"</p>",
